Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:30.41,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let's chase our dreams...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.52,0:01:35.55,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... holding hearts burning...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:39.95,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... like the summer sunshine.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.06,0:01:43.89,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we have courage...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:47.06,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... at 100 miles an hour...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.17,0:01:55.16,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... l'm sure the door will open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.27,0:02:02.25,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Since sadness is the road{\i0}\N{\i1}that leads to smiles...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.31,0:02:10.95,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... dull, dingy shoes will{\i0}\N{\i1}start to shine, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:17.65,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The most wonderful dream{\i0}\N{\i1}in the world...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.76,0:02:24.36,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The poundingbeat speeds up.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.47,0:02:31.53,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The eyes are prisms that{\i0}\N{\i1}catch the wind...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:39.38,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... and in the voices of{\i0}\N{\i1}countless friends...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.48,0:02:46.26,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... I feel happiness.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:55.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Regarding the matter at hand,\NI hope to hear from you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.27,0:02:58.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,Understood, Sir. I'll look\Ninto it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.88,0:03:17.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, could you unload your Moto-Compo?\NI'm going to check it out after lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.43,0:03:18.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Riiight...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:20.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, you couldn't\Nhelp it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:22.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,The GSX has a lot more power\Nthan your Moto-Compo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:29.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right, why don't we go and have a\Nchat with the folks at the DMV?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.15,0:03:38.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,At the very least, your\Nlicense is history!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:40.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima, thanks!\NI owe you one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:45.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it... I happened to be\Nin the neighborhood. Lucky, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.37,0:03:46.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're a big help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.62,0:03:48.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, working hard, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.34,0:03:52.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where's Tsujimoto?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh? Natsumi is right h...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:55.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.55,0:04:01.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, gee, am I bummed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.43,0:04:04.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,That Miyuki... All she said was,\N"You couldn't help it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.06,0:04:08.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't you think that was\Nuncalled for? 'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:14.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,...my Moto-Compo makes up for its lack\Nof power with superior maneuverability!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:15.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it, Oshou?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.40,0:04:18.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,If the race always goes to the biggest\Nand fastest, then we're history!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,It really sucks big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,'Cause we won't be able\Nto make enough busts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.70,0:04:25.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,In other words, you're jealous\Nof the White Bike Troopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.71,0:04:36.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh? I didn't know you'd been\Nadopted by the Temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:45.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hmm..."Jealous," eh?\NMaybe I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:50.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, what really pisses me off is the way\NMiyuki tried to make me feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:55.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Isn't that called "defeatism?"\NIsn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.07,0:05:00.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much\Nfor the tea...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:03.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and for listening to me spill my\Nguts. I feel much better, Oshou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:05.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:07.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.25,0:05:10.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:13.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,My! You haven't\Nchanged a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:17.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why don't you have a seat, and\NI'll get you a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:19.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... You know Oshou?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:20.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. He's my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:22.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,M... Mentor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:25.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,He was a policeman for many\Nyears. Also, he's my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.89,0:05:28.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh? Your uncle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:33.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...\NChief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.11,0:05:40.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! I keep telling him, "Let me\Nknow when the guest leaves!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.41,0:05:48.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,A Female...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.12,0:05:49.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,...White Bike Trooper?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:50.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,You want ME to be one?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:53.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's right. If you'd rather recommend\Nsomeone else, then I'll consider it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.25,0:05:56.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,...but I can't think of anyone better\Nqualified than you, Tsujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:58.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll do it! I'll do it! Please,\Nlet me do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.05,0:06:03.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is that so? In that case, I'll send my\Nrecommendation to Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.18,0:06:03.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Headquarters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes... you'll be reporting\Nto Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.31,0:06:09.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... Then, I'll have\Nto transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.48,0:06:14.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking you to give me\Na definite answer right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:15.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take your time\Nand think it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:17.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Take my time?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.15,0:06:20.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you can let me know your decision by\Nthe end of the week, that'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.24,0:06:24.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,B... By the end\Nof the week?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.30,0:06:40.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:41.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Er... Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:45.05,Style1,,0,0,0,,Lunch break was over\Nfive minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.18,0:06:47.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, never mind that... Come\Nand check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:52.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,I've been tinkering with the Moto-Compo.\NIt should burn a little different...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.85,0:06:53.85,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.06,0:06:55.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,I thought that it could use\Na little more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.24,0:07:07.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.32,0:07:07.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.87,0:07:10.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about what I said earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.99,0:07:12.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,It was very inconsiderate of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:13.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is that why you were working\Non the bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.91,0:07:17.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes, but wouldn't you want to keep\Nit in top condition all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:24.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.67,0:07:27.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... Wh... What\Ndid I say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:32.60,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\c&H000000&\bord4\3c&HB7AFD2&\frz348.3\pos(722.67,296.67)}Wakaba Preschool\N\NSchool Play
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.10,0:07:32.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Be sure to come see us perform\N"The Rocky Mountain!"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:34.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll be the mischievous Tanuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.23,0:07:38.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Old Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.56,0:07:40.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Bunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.40,0:07:41.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm Soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:48.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I can't make\Nit this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.66,0:07:52.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,What?! Why?!\NWhy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:18.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Maybe tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:45.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I've\Neaten anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.42,0:08:49.68,Style1,,0,0,0,,It seems like my appetite gets worse\Nevery day. What a bummer...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:02.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ah. So that's how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.31,0:09:03.81,Style1,,0,0,0,,All I can tell you is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.94,0:09:06.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's far better to try something\Nand regret it...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.32,0:09:09.03,Style1,,0,0,0,,...than to not try something\Nand regret that...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.99,0:09:12.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Chances like this come to you\Nonly if you make them...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:15.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and you have to make the best\Nof them when you get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.16,0:09:17.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Want me to tell\Nher for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.46,0:09:24.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:27.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll tell her myself.\NIf I were Miyuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:30.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,...l'd wanna be told\Ndirectly, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:32.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,I figured you'd\Nsay that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.35,0:09:37.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki also wants to be told directly\Nhow you feel about her, Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.47,0:09:40.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... Why are you bringing\Nthat up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:43.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,'Cause, if I do become\Na Trooper...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.27,0:09:46.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,...then I won't be a member of\NBokuto Precinct, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to solve all your\Nproblems long-distance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't you care, Miyuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.00,Style1,,0,0,0,,If you don't do anything,\Nshe'll leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,I know all about it,\Nyou know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:09.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,How you busted your butt making\Na dossier on Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.84,0:10:13.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,...when you first heard that she'd\Nbe transferring to our station!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,And how, on her first day, you\Neven went out to pick her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.97,0:10:19.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,I remember you said, "Oh, that Natsumi!\NShe's so late getting here!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.10,0:10:22.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:25.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aw, c'mon, Miyuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:30.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Umm... Miyuki? Can I\Ntalk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,A going-away present for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,You'll be living in\Nthe dorm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:43.41,Style1,,0,0,0,,That alarm clock is guaranteed\Nto prevent oversleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:46.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,How long have you known?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.25,0:10:49.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Since you went out to lunch\Nby yourself at the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:51.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're cruel... You should've\Nsaid something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.13,0:10:53.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.26,0:10:56.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey, I bet this'll electrocute\Nme or explode, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.93,0:11:02.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Hang in there, Tsujimoto!"{\i0}\N{\i1}"Hang in there, Tsujimoto!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.77,0:11:04.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Just for you, because you\Nare a fan of the Chief...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.60,0:11:07.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,...I obtained five voice samples\Nof the man himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.69,0:11:10.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,What do you think? With this,\Nyou will rise and shine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.32,0:11:13.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't break it, okay? It took a\Nwhile to make, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:19.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm not rational like Miyuki! I'll be\Nblunt; I don't want you to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:23.45,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aw, it's okay! I will be back,\Nso be a good girl, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:33.76,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1006.67,367.33)\fs42\c&H080002&}Letter of \NRecommendation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,You can't even balance for 10 seconds?!\NWhat're you gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.69,0:11:48.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto! You can get\Noff the plank now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.11,Style1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.27,0:11:52.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're holding up\Nthe whole line!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.94,0:11:53.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,Riiight...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.32,0:12:00.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:00.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:02.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tsujimoto...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.74,0:12:06.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,The others are here to learn how\Nto control their motorcycles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:10.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand, ought to learn\Nhow to control yourself! Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.63,0:12:12.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eeeeuuuuuuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:15.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,This is Patrol School. We don't "Eeuuh"\Nhere. It's "Yes, Sir!" Got that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.67,0:12:18.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yessir...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:29.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get to you... You've\Ngot natural talent, Tsujimoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.19,0:12:30.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,But, for some reason, I'm not\Nso confident anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:33.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah... I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.00,0:12:50.62,Style1,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:53.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,We've got to get going soon,\NNats... I mean, Yoriko!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.17,0:12:56.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:08.89,Style1,,0,0,0,,Do you think Natsumi's\Nstaying healthy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.10,0:13:11.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm pretty sure.\NAre you worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:13.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,You think she's\Ndoing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Of course. It's Natsumi we're\Ntalking about, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.48,0:13:16.73,Style1,,0,0,0,,What about you,\NMiyuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.82,0:13:18.94,Style1,,0,0,0,,Are you doing\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:22.24,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, I hope I'm doing as\Ngood a job as she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:45.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"What's wrong, Tsujimoto?"{\i0}\N{\i1}"What's wrong, Tsujimoto?"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.43,0:13:51.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Riiight, Chief... I'm\Nhangin' in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.54,0:14:13.46,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where are your\Nmanners?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:17.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,You won't get away\Nfrom me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.84,0:14:23.72,Style1,,0,0,0,,The guy's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Natsumi! Your\NFoot Brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.18,0:14:31.14,Style1,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything\Nlike that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.87,0:14:53.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Aren't\Nyou going inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:56.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ha ha... for some reason, I'm\Nkinda embarrassed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:57.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,Is today your day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:58.88,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:00.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,They've decided to let me make\Nmy debut as a Trooper...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:03.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,...so I guess I'm here to let you know,\Nor maybe just to say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.80,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh! That's great,\Nisn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:07.93,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:11.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.39,0:15:13.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,And... Howdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:16.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Umm... Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Lookin' good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sure could use your\Nhelp around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:24.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,The cafeteria lady was saying that sales\Nare way down since you left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.49,0:15:27.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,Where's Miyuki? Is she\Nin the garage again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.75,0:15:38.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.81,0:15:55.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.43,0:15:57.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.20,0:16:09.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,The way I look at it, the damage\Ncould have been much worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.57,0:16:10.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.53,0:16:13.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Still, I guess I'm still not used to\Nbeing without you, Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, you live and learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:20.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hey... maybe I should\Ncome back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.96,0:16:21.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.30,0:16:25.92,Style1,,0,0,0,,W... What are you\Ntalking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.05,0:16:29.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's not like you, Natsumi, to quit\Nafter deciding to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:30.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,R... Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.64,0:16:33.39,Style1,,0,0,0,,Y... Yeah! Besides, aren't you gonna\Nbe riding escort for the marathon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:36.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, that's terrific! You've got\Nto go and strut your stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Well, it's only a half-marathon...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,I just don't understand why\Nyou're acting so wimpy...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.73,0:16:45.61,Style1,,0,0,0,,...when I've been trying to be as\Nstrong as you always were...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.03,0:16:55.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,WHY, YOU!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.16,0:17:00.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sob!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.69,0:17:23.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,What're you doing with\Nthe Moto-Compo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.44,0:17:25.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Weren't you talking things over\Nwith Tsujimoto just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:27.90,Style1,,0,0,0,,I thought that I'd put it away\Nin the warehouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.07,0:17:30.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,Put it away?! Why would\Nyou want to do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.99,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wait... What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:37.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi was saying... that\Nshe might come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:39.50,Style1,,0,0,0,,Because I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:43.08,Style1,,0,0,0,,Because I wasn't strong enough,\NI made her say such a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:44.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,'Cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:49.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,...for her to say such a thing,\Nit must be the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:54.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,I haven't had the strength to try to\Nget used to being without her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:02.98,Style1,,0,0,0,,You don't need to put the bike away.\NThere's no reason to put it away...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.24,0:18:16.12,Style2,,0,0,0,,"Bokuto District Half-Marathon\NGrand Prix"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:20.66,Style1,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the course\Nfollows a 21km path.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:25.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Our station will be responsible for\Nregulating traffic in the vicinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.25,0:18:27.21,Style1,,0,0,0,,We can expect that traffic will\Nbe heavily congested.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:29.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,This won't be a cakewalk, so be\Nprepared... and good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:30.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aye, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:31.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's get rolling!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.26,0:18:40.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Starting gun in 20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.73,0:18:47.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Finally. Let's relax and\Nenjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:50.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,I already made a pitstop,\Nso I'm hunky-dory!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:51.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,10 seconds...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.07,0:18:54.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,On your marks...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:14.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,We're sorry, but this route\Nwill be closed until 3 P. M!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.97,0:19:16.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.01,0:19:18.47,Style1,,0,0,0,,She's here! She's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:20.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.39,0:19:23.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Old Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:24.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Old Man!\NI'm the Tanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:24.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm the Tanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:25.56,Style1,,0,0,0,,Old Lady here!\NI'm the Tanuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.56,0:19:25.69,Style1,,0,0,0,,Old Lady here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.69,0:19:26.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Old Lady here!\NSoup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.60,0:19:26.77,Style1,,0,0,0,,Soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.77,0:19:27.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Bunny!\NSoup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:31.57,Style1,,0,0,0,,Rocky Mountain!\NRocky Mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.28,0:19:37.95,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sheesh! That was it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.12,0:19:40.12,Style1,,0,0,0,,Mega-boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:58.09,Style1,,0,0,0,,That's weird... Out\Nof gas already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\i1\an8}Tsujimoto, you're going too fast!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.57,0:20:17.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oops!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:20.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.49,0:20:21.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it?! What's\Ngoing on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.74,0:20:25.75,Style1,,0,0,0,,A vehicle on fire! And it couldn't\Nhave happened at a worse time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:30.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you\Nthink you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Back up, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:34.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Can't you see that's dangerous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.72,0:20:37.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:38.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Radio for assistance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.72,0:20:40.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'll try to re-direct the cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:45.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Please back up slowly! Don't rush!\NBack up slowly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:47.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Your cooperation is greatly\Nappreciated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.48,0:20:49.44,Style1,,0,0,0,,Say what? I can't\Nhear you very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.56,0:20:51.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,In flames?! A truck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.31,0:20:53.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko, calm down and\Ngive me the location!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.65,Style1,,0,0,0,,Okay, gotcha! I'll be\Nright there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:05.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Stay on top on what's happening\Non the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.66,0:21:07.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,We must keep the spectators\Nfrom panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:14.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,We may have a problem here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:19.01,Style1,,0,0,0,,A fire?! At a time\Nlike this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:21.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Hold a sec... Lemme check\Nit out with Headquarters!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:25.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:30.06,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gee! At a time like this, if Natsumi\Nwere here, she'd just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:32.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,NO WAY!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:34.02,Style1,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.23,0:21:36.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:38.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,We've got to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.24,0:21:39.15,Style1,,0,0,0,,What're you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the car!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:43.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:55.04,Style1,,0,0,0,,In this kind of situation, who cares\Nabout a few dents and scratches?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:04.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Anyone injured? And how many\Nofficers are en route?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:06.30,Style1,,0,0,0,,They cut me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:07.97,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto... your face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:10.64,Style1,,0,0,0,,We escorts shouldn't look\Nlike we're in a bad mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:14.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,How 'bout this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:24.20,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yo, Yoriko, how's\Nit going?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.36,0:22:28.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Nakajima! The fire trucks can't get\Nhere because of all the cars!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.87,0:22:32.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Damn! We won't be able to do anything\Nto stop this kind of fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.71,0:22:35.67,Style1,,0,0,0,,Damn! Hold your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:40.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gotta retreat for\Nthe time being!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:47.51,Style1,,0,0,0,,To the Kitten with a Beautiful\NSmile... This is the Fox.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.77,0:22:56.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,H... Hold on! How on Earth\Ndo you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.90,0:22:59.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,I've told you what\NI know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.61,0:23:02.53,Style1,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you.\NI wish you the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.70,0:23:04.91,Style1,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.07,0:23:06.32,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.41,0:23:08.37,Style1,,0,0,0,,...but please handle things\Nfrom here on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.91,0:23:13.87,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:21.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,Aw, just when we were\Nable to see her...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:27.55,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:32.27,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi!\NBye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.43,0:23:36.31,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Cool! Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.61,0:23:42.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko... How are\Nyou doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:44.74,Style1,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.90,0:23:49.49,Style1,,0,0,0,,We took care of moving the cars.\NNow all we need is a fire truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.66,0:23:52.33,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I owe you\Nanother one...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.12,0:23:58.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,Kobayakawa, Nakajima...\NWell done.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.67,0:24:00.59,Style1,,0,0,0,,The fire truck should\Narrive very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.96,0:24:02.71,Style1,,0,0,0,,What about the Marathon?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.88,0:24:04.63,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's running smoothly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.80,0:24:06.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:14.35,Style1,,0,0,0,,Like I've told you already, the road's\Nblocked off; I can't get through!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.43,0:24:16.48,Style1,,0,0,0,,Look, you aren't the only one\Ninconvenienced by this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.64,0:24:18.60,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh... Nakajima!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.77,0:24:20.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,Wh... What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.69,0:24:26.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yoriko! Put your\Nseat belt on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.86,0:24:28.82,Style1,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's\Ngoin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.87,0:24:36.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like Nakajima\Ncan get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.75,0:24:37.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,We've got to do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.83,0:24:39.17,Style1,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.33,0:24:40.13,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.25,0:24:42.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,Let's stop that thing NOW!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.05,0:24:50.43,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.31,0:24:57.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,This thing is too heavy! We're\Nnot going to stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.02,0:25:00.19,Style1,,0,0,0,,Natsumi! Put it\Nin reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:01.86,Style1,,0,0,0,,H... How am I supposed to do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.86,0:25:03.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Calm down! I'll tell you how!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.65,0:25:06.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,First, apply the side brakes\Nto lock the rear wheels!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.94,0:25:09.40,Style1,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.61,0:25:11.70,Style1,,0,0,0,,Step on the clutch, then shift\Ninto reverse!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.78,Style1,,0,0,0,,Step off the clutch... Release\Nthe side brakes...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.99,0:25:17.29,Style1,,0,0,0,,...and FLOOR IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.83,0:25:22.79,Style1,,0,0,0,,Stop, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.52,0:25:45.52,Style1,,0,0,0,,Tsujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.65,0:25:47.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fs52\an8}Note:{\b0} She is doing the hand gesture for "sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.37,0:26:01.25,Style1,,0,0,0,,Sakai... I'd better give\Nthis back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.41,0:26:03.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.17,0:26:05.34,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're gonna quit,\Naren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.54,0:26:10.42,Style1,,0,0,0,,I realized that I don't belong on\Na fixed route, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.59,0:26:11.76,Style1,,0,0,0,,A perfect 10!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.93,0:26:12.84,Style1,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:15.18,Style1,,0,0,0,,Your smile was excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.30,0:26:17.26,Style1,,0,0,0,,That was the best I've\Never seen you make!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.28,0:26:38.58,Style1,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.74,0:26:40.54,Style1,,0,0,0,,You're the one\Nwho told me...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.66,0:26:42.16,Style1,,0,0,0,,"Chances like this come to you\Nonly if you make them...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.37,0:26:44.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,"...and you have to make the best of\Nthem when you get them." Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.75,0:26:48.38,Style1,,0,0,0,,So I hear she pulled yet another\Nimpulsive stunt, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.55,0:26:49.96,Style1,,0,0,0,,It's so like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:01.22,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yo! Is the seat next\Nto you taken?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.85,0:27:06.23,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yo, girlfriend, could I\Nhitch a ride wit'cha?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:10.36,Style1,,0,0,0,,Miyuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.78,0:27:15.07,Style1,,0,0,0,,Silly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.28,0:27:18.83,Style1,,0,0,0,,Yup! That's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.09,0:28:25.43,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I love the smile you always have.{\i0}\N{\i1}With all the passion I have...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.48,0:28:34.82,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...I will protect you from sighs.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.94,0:28:42.70,Style2,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The sunset skyline flashes past{\i0}\N{\i1}in my side-view mirror.{\i0}
